<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Agência de Viagens</title>

  <style>

    :root{
      --azul: #4ea8de;
      --escuro: #1b263b;
      --branco: #ffffff;
    }

    *{
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial;
    }

    body{
      background-color: #0d1b2a;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .card{
      background-color: var(--escuro);
      width: 650px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .texto{
      color: var(--branco);
    }

    h1{
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p{
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .botoes{
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn{
      background-color: var(--azul);
      border: none;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn:hover{
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    img{
      width: 230px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="texto">
      <h1>Travel Time</h1>

      <p>
        Viaje para lugares lindos e aproveite suas férias
        com os melhores pacotes de viagem.
      </p>

      <div class="botoes">
        <button class="btn">Pacotes</button>
        <button class="btn">Contato</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="praia">

  </div>

</body>
</html>